{"sha": "20683c6ec09a8f616a6eb65dd328a58c82ab5a0391d2c72570fb8788ca2e4e4c", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:findim} 章 --- 有限维}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:1}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $z = -x - y$: $F = \\{(x, y, -x-y)\\} =", "        \\operatorname{Vect}\\bigl((1,0,-1), (0,1,-1)\\bigr)$；这两个", "        向量线性无关（由坐标即可看出）：$\\dim F = 2$。", "  \\item $G = \\{(x, x, 2t, t)\\} =", "        \\operatorname{Vect}\\bigl((1,1,0,0), (0,0,2,1)\\bigr)$：线性无关，", "        $\\dim G = 2$.", "  \\item $P(1) = P'(1) = 0$ 意味着 $(X-1)^2 \\mid P$", "        （由\\cref{prop:b1:poly:multiplicity}），$P = (X-1)^2(aX + b)$。", "        基为 $\\bigl((X-1)^2, X(X-1)^2\\bigr)$，维数为 $2$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:2}", "$(3,5,7) = (1,1,1) + 2(1,2,3)$ 与 $(0,1,2) = (1,2,3) - (1,1,1)$：", "两者都是前两个向量的线性组合，而前两个向量线性无关（彼此不成比例）。", "秩为 $2$；张成的子空间的基为：", "$\\bigl((1,1,1), (1,2,3)\\bigr)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:3}", "不妨添加 $e_1 = (1,0,0,0)$ 与 $e_3 = (0,0,1,0)$。向量族", "$\\bigl((1,1,0,0), (0,0,1,1), e_1, e_3\\bigr)$ 线性无关：考察", "零线性组合 $\\alpha(1,1,0,0) + \\beta(0,0,1,1) + \\gamma e_1 + \\delta", "e_3 = 0$ 写作 $(\\alpha + \\gamma, \\alpha, \\beta + \\delta, \\beta) =", "0$，于是 $\\alpha = \\beta = 0$，进而 $\\gamma = \\delta = 0$。四个", "线性无关向量，维数为 $4$，故为基", "        （见\\cref{prop:b1:findim:twoofthree}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:4}", "次数 $0, 1, 2, 3$ 两两不同：线性无关", "        （由\\cref{prop:b1:vspaces:freecriteria}）可知，四个向量", "维数为 $4$，故构成基。对 $X^3$ 作向下展开：", "\\[", "X(X-1)(X-2) = X^3 - 3X^2 + 2X,", "\\qquad", "X(X-1) = X^2 - X,", "\\]", "于是 $X^3 - X(X-1)(X-2) = 3X^2 - 2X$；又 $3X^2 - 2X = 3(X^2 - X) + X", "= 3\\,X(X-1) + X$。由此得", "\\[", "X^3 = X(X-1)(X-2) + 3\\,X(X-1) + 1\\cdot X + 0\\cdot 1 :", "\\]", "坐标为 $(0, 1, 3, 1)$，相对于基 $\\bigl(1, X, X(X-1),", "X(X-1)(X-2)\\bigr)$。（这些数实际上是斯特林数。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:5}", "由格拉斯曼公式 $\\dim(F \\cap G) = 4 + 5 - \\dim(F + G)$，且 $F + G$ 是", "$E$ 中包含 $G$ 的子空间：$5 \\leq \\dim(F+G) \\leq 7$。由此", "$\\dim(F \\cap G) \\in \\{2, 3, 4\\}$。在 $\\R^7$ 中构造实例，", "以标准基 $(e_1, \\dots, e_7)$，取 $G =", "\\operatorname{Vect}(e_1, \\dots, e_5)$:", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item $F = \\operatorname{Vect}(e_1, e_2, e_6, e_7)$: $F + G = \\R^7$,", "        交空间为 $\\operatorname{Vect}(e_1, e_2)$，维数为 $2$；", "  \\item $F = \\operatorname{Vect}(e_1, e_2, e_3, e_6)$：交空间", "        的维数为 $3$；", "  \\item $F = \\operatorname{Vect}(e_1, e_2, e_3, e_4) \\subseteq G$:", "        维数为 $4$。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:6}", "$H$ 是子空间（与\\cref{exo:b1:vspaces:1}~(4) 完全相同）。由", "因式定理（见\\cref{thm:b1:poly:factor}），$P \\in H \\iff P =", "(X-1)Q$，且 $\\deg Q \\leq n - 1$。映射 $Q \\mapsto (X-1)Q$ 为", "从 $\\R_{n-1}[X]$ 到 $H$ 上的线性双射，于是 $H$ 的一组基为", "\\[", "\\bigl((X-1),\\ (X-1)X,\\ (X-1)X^2,\\ \\dots,\\ (X-1)X^{n-1}\\bigr),", "\\qquad \\dim H = n .", "\\]", "一个补子空间为 $\\operatorname{Vect}(1)$（常值多项式）。事实上", "$H \\cap \\operatorname{Vect}(1) = \\{0\\}$（非零常数在", "$1$ 处不为零），且维数之和为 $n + 1$：由格拉斯曼公式，$H", "\\oplus \\operatorname{Vect}(1) = \\R_n[X]$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:7}", "删除：删去 $u_p$ 后，张成子空间只能缩小；并且它", "至多缩小一维：将 $u_p$ 加回较小张成子空间的基，", "即得较大张成子空间的一个生成组，其中至多多出", "一个向量。对称地，添加向量 $v$：新的", "张成子空间包含原来的，至多多出一个生成元，因此其", "维数为 $r$（若 $v$ 已在张成子空间中）或 $r + 1$", "（否则，由\\cref{prop:b1:vspaces:freecriteria}~(2)，", "线性无关组可扩充为基）。两者合起来，即得“秩是", "$1$-Lipschitz”的结论。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:8}", "沿严格递增的链，维数严格增加", "（$F_i \\subseteq F_{i+1}$，$F_i \\neq F_{i+1}$，且", "由\\cref{thm:b1:findim:subspaces}，维数相等将迫使", "空间相等）。于是 $\\dim F_1 < \\dim F_2 < \\dots < \\dim F_k$ 是", "$\\intint{0}{n}$ 中的严格递增整数序列：至多有", "$n + 1$ 个值，$k \\leq n + 1$。$\\R^n$ 中的极大链为：", "\\[", "\\{0\\} \\subsetneq \\operatorname{Vect}(e_1) \\subsetneq", "\\operatorname{Vect}(e_1, e_2) \\subsetneq \\dots \\subsetneq \\R^n ,", "\\]", "长度恰为 $n + 1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:findim:9}", "$F + G$ 严格包含 $F$（因为 $G \\not\\subseteq F$），于是", "$\\dim(F + G) = n$，由格拉斯曼公式得 $\\dim(F \\cap G) = (n-1) +", "(n-1) - n = n - 2$.", ""]}